@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+# Independent Composer projects
+
+Open this directory as one workspace, then open `apps/a/index.php` and
+`apps/b/index.php`. Both applications declare `App\Service`, with a different
+method. Completion and navigation follow the application containing the caller.
+Try either opening order, edit a Service without saving, and Undo the change.
+The other application's declarations remain independent.
+
+No packages or generated vendor files are required. The two applications use
+separate Composer PSR-4 roots. Run each entry point separately to check its
+runtime contract:
+
+```sh
+php -d zend.assertions=1 apps/a/index.php
+php -d zend.assertions=1 apps/b/index.php
+```
+
+Each script deliberately loads only its own Service. They are independent PHP
+applications; their identically named classes cannot be loaded into one PHP
+process together.
